# Wall 2 — release/ inner repo whitelist (Security W1 Finding 1).
#
# Default-deny. Only the listed paths can be `git add`-ed without -f.
# This wall is symmetric with Wall 3 (.github/workflows/no-source.yml)
# so any new file shape is rejected at both gates by default.
#
# To allow a new artefact shape: add it here AND in no-source.yml's allowlist
# in the same commit, with a one-line spec note explaining why.

*
.*

!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!setup-*.exe
!RiTrade-setup-*.exe
!*.sha256
!update-manifest.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
# EULA ships with every release since the 1.1.0 license swap (work 0139 era);
# allowed here AND in no-source.yml per the walls' symmetry rule.
!EULA.md
!release-notes-v*.md
